{
  "_meta": {
    "spdx-license": "EUPL-1.2",
    "spdx-copyright": "2026 Conduction B.V.",
    "change": "add-invoice-pdf-export-with-ubl-peppol-support",
    "adr": "ADR-037 modular manifest fragment \u2014 never edit src/manifest.json",
    "description": "REQ-EINV-007 \u2014 adds the 'Send e-invoice' action + Peppol delivery-status indicator to the existing ARInvoiceDetail page (owned by bookkeeping-accounts-receivable-core). CAUTION for future editors: buildManifest()'s mergePages() replaces a page WHOLESALE by id (no deep merge, see nextcloud-vue/src/utils/buildManifest.js) \u2014 this fragment therefore carries a FULL COPY of ARInvoiceDetail's base definition from src/manifest.json plus two additive changes: (1) 'actionsComponent': 'AREInvoiceActions' resolves the Send action + status chip into the page header's actions slot (registry.js, kind:'widget', any kind is eligible for actionsComponent resolution per ADR-036); (2) the delivery-status fields (deliveryStatus/transmissionId/payloadFileUri/deliveryDetail) are appended to the 'invoice-document' data widget's include list so they render read-only alongside the rest of the invoice. If bookkeeping-accounts-receivable-core's owning fragment/base page changes, this copy MUST be re-synced or the later-wins overlay will silently drop those changes."
  },
  "menu": [],
  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "ARInvoiceDetail",
      "route": "/bookkeeping/accounts-receivable/:id",
      "type": "detail",
      "title": "AR Invoice",
      "actionsComponent": "AREInvoiceActions",
      "slots": {
        "widget-invoice-down-payments": "ArDownPaymentPanel"
      },
      "config": {
        "register": "shillinq",
        "schema": "ARInvoice",
        "documentationUrl": "https://shillinq.conduction.nl/guides/create-invoices",
        "indexRoute": "AccountsReceivable",
        "_note": "Billing-document archetype \u2014 a receivable invoice sent to a customer. Body leads with the invoice's own fields (schema-driven Data widget: number, type, dates, EN 16931 party/tax fields, the folded dunning/writeOff summary groups, GL link, and \u2014 added by add-invoice-pdf-export-with-ubl-peppol-support \u2014 the Peppol deliveryStatus/transmissionId/payloadFileUri/deliveryDetail fields) beside a Related panel for the customerId FK. Dunning history uses the real credit-control schema DunningRun (filter factuurId=@objectId, rowRoute to the existing DunningRunDetail page). Totals surface as summaryAggregates KPI chips (gross/due/paid, all sums over the invoice's own field via filter id=@objectId, the established self-value idiom) plus a dunning-run count. The header actionsComponent (AREInvoiceActions) renders the Send e-invoice action + delivery-status chip (REQ-EINV-007).",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": "invoice-panels",
            "type": "tabs",
            "title": "Invoice",
            "content": {
              "tabs": [
                {
                  "widgetIds": [
                    "invoice-document",
                    "invoice-money"
                  ],
                  "label": "Overview"
                },
                {
                  "widgetId": "invoice-dunning",
                  "label": "Reminders",
                  "countFrom": "widget"
                },
                {
                  "widgetId": "invoice-files",
                  "label": "Files"
                },
                {
                  "widgetId": "invoice-history",
                  "label": "History"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "invoice-document",
            "type": "data",
            "title": "Document",
            "icon": "FileDocument",
            "content": {
              "columns": 2,
              "include": [
                "invoiceNumber",
                "customerId",
                "invoiceDate",
                "dueDate",
                "currency",
                "periodId",
                "lifecycleState",
                "ublRef",
                "sourceDocumentUri",
                "deliveryStatus",
                "transmissionId",
                "payloadFileUri",
                "deliveryDetail"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "invoice-money",
            "type": "data",
            "title": "Money",
            "icon": "CurrencyEur",
            "content": {
              "columns": 2,
              "include": [
                "grossAmount",
                "vatAmount",
                "netAmount",
                "amountDue",
                "paidAmount",
                "glTransactionId",
                "matchedBankLineId",
                "administrationId"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "invoice-down-payments",
            "type": "custom",
            "title": "Down payments",
            "icon": "CashPlus",
            "_note": "sales-down-payments REQ-SDP-003 and REQ-SDP-005, rendered through the page slot widget-invoice-down-payments -> ArDownPaymentPanel. It shows the order's down payments with their paid state and the invoice that deducted each, and on a draft invoice offers to deduct a customer's open down payments. Custom because it reads GET /api/ar-invoices/{id}/down-payments, a cross-invoice lookup no declarative widget can express, and writes the deduction through POST .../down-payment-deductions."
          },
          {
            "id": "invoice-dunning",
            "type": "object-list",
            "title": "Dunning history",
            "icon": "Bell",
            "content": {
              "register": "shillinq",
              "schema": "DunningRun",
              "filter": {
                "invoiceId": "@objectId"
              },
              "sort": {
                "field": "stageNr",
                "dir": "asc"
              },
              "limit": 20,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "key": "stageNr",
                  "label": "Stage"
                },
                {
                  "key": "executedOn",
                  "label": "Executed"
                },
                {
                  "key": "channel",
                  "label": "Channel"
                },
                {
                  "key": "deliveryStatus",
                  "label": "Delivery status"
                },
                {
                  "key": "collectionCostAmount",
                  "label": "Collection costs"
                }
              ],
              "rowRoute": "DunningRunDetail",
              "viewAllRoute": "DunningRuns",
              "viewAllQuery": {
                "invoiceId": "@objectId"
              },
              "emptyText": "No dunning runs have been triggered for this invoice.",
              "allowCreate": false
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "invoice-files",
            "type": "integration",
            "integrationId": "files",
            "title": "Invoice PDF & attachments",
            "icon": "FileDocument"
          },
          {
            "id": "invoice-history",
            "type": "audit-trail",
            "title": "History"
          },
          {
            "id": "invoice-customer",
            "type": "facts",
            "title": "Customer",
            "content": {
              "source": {
                "register": "shillinq",
                "schema": "CustomerMaster",
                "id": "@object.customerId"
              },
              "fields": [
                {
                  "as": "title",
                  "path": "legalName",
                  "route": {
                    "name": "CustomerDetail",
                    "params": {
                      "id": "@source.id"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Email",
                  "path": "email",
                  "format": "email"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Customer number",
                  "path": "customerId"
                }
              ],
              "emptyText": "No customer linked"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "invoice-payment",
            "type": "facts",
            "title": "Payment",
            "content": {
              "fields": [
                {
                  "as": "pill",
                  "path": "lifecycleState",
                  "map": {
                    "draft": "Draft",
                    "issued": "Outstanding",
                    "paid": "Paid",
                    "overdue": "Overdue",
                    "disputed": "Disputed",
                    "written-off": "Written off"
                  },
                  "variantMap": {
                    "draft": "default",
                    "issued": "warning",
                    "paid": "success",
                    "overdue": "error",
                    "disputed": "warning",
                    "written-off": "default"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Payment method",
                  "path": "paymentMethod",
                  "map": {
                    "bank_transfer": "Bank transfer",
                    "direct_debit": "Direct debit",
                    "cash": "Cash",
                    "card": "Card",
                    "other": "Other"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Due date",
                  "path": "dueDate",
                  "format": "date"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "invoice-related",
            "type": "related",
            "title": "Customer",
            "icon": "LinkVariant"
          }
        ],
        "layout": [
          {
            "id": "1",
            "widgetId": "invoice-panels",
            "gridX": 0,
            "gridY": 0,
            "gridWidth": 12,
            "gridHeight": 14
          },
          {
            "id": "2",
            "widgetId": "invoice-down-payments",
            "gridX": 0,
            "gridY": 14,
            "gridWidth": 12,
            "gridHeight": 4
          }
        ],
        "lifecycleActions": true,
        "sidebar": {
          "enabled": true,
          "showMetadata": true,
          "tabs": [
            {
              "id": "audit",
              "label": "History",
              "icon": "History",
              "widgets": [
                {
                  "type": "audit"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "sideColumn": [
          "invoice-payment",
          "invoice-customer",
          "invoice-related"
        ],
        "breadcrumb": {
          "label": "Sales invoices",
          "route": "AccountsReceivable"
        },
        "identifierField": "invoiceNumber",
        "statusPill": {
          "field": "lifecycleState",
          "labels": {
            "draft": "Draft",
            "issued": "Sent",
            "paid": "Paid",
            "overdue": "Overdue",
            "disputed": "Disputed",
            "written-off": "Written off"
          },
          "colorMap": {
            "draft": "default",
            "issued": "info",
            "paid": "success",
            "overdue": "error",
            "disputed": "warning",
            "written-off": "default"
          }
        },
        "headerMeta": "Due {dueDate|date}",
        "tabsLabel": "Invoice parts",
        "headerActions": [
          {
            "id": "agree-payment-plan",
            "label": "Agree a payment plan",
            "type": "open-modal",
            "target": "AgreePaymentPlanModal",
            "icon": "CalendarClock",
            "props": {
              "open": true,
              "from": "invoice"
            },
            "visibleWhen": {
              "field": "lifecycleState",
              "op": "eq",
              "value": "overdue"
            }
          }
        ],
        "_boardNote": "Board ShVerkoopfactuur. The four totals tiles read 0 (a sum over a filter on the invoice id); the Money card keeps the amounts and the Reminders tab the count. Agree a payment plan is restored: this fragment replaces the base page whole."
      }
    }
  ]
}
